{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e6608a27fd555f9af50b0131c1621d01a790e67070a799733de7656857fca0be","ja":"おっ、命中！　さすがだね、すばるん。けど的あてだと、\n水風船がどんどん割れて、すぐなくなっちゃうかも。","zh":"噢，击中了！真不愧是昴。不过拿来当靶子打的话，\n水气球就会一个接一个破掉，可能很快就没了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3de155b250ba2d50c44303b40522c87642cfa7d113b51beb3fa5910e123bb08f","ja":"そっか……。\nじゃあ、キャッチボールはどうだ！？","zh":"这样啊……。\n那玩传接球怎么样！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"54786b687f596a4b762394c3573e89124a3b77a6b967aba3eab707575266d303","ja":"それ、結構、難しそうじゃない！？","zh":"那个，感觉不是挺难的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3712c427bc91959c1dd558ea2000cf486a98ddd9ba5c2ff7cb8bcccc67ff8953","ja":"けど、ゼッタイ面白いぜ！　最初は近くから始めて、\nどんどん離れて、どこまでいけるか挑戦しようぜ！","zh":"不过，绝对超有趣的！先从近处开始，\n再渐渐拉开距离，挑战看看能到多远吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"32a3816c42f7f157c7a412356cc684b1cb1027ca3e59b6ad6452bbb27d4263e0","ja":"オッケー！\nその挑戦、茜ちゃんもバッチリ乗っちゃうよ～♪","zh":"OK！\n这挑战，小茜也欣然接受啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1622.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"7c6b25c9dfee54b0338976bc0cace4d98ef11364d5d7e6fdfa3ac6cc618e3ebe","ja":"あれ？　屋上から声が聞こえる。\nなんかやってるのかな……見に行ってみよ～っと♪","zh":"咦？屋顶好像有声音传过来。\n是在做什么吗……去看看好～啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
